mission "The Pilot's Ledger"
    name "The Pilot's Ledger"
    description "Carry the ledger to Elian Rusk at Port Azure. Keep it below deck and out of the inspectors' sight."
    source "Lantern Bay"
    destination "Port Azure"
    reward 430
    speaker offer "Harbourmaster"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster"
    to offer
        has "Lanterns Under Black Sails: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `A rescued pilot has a ledger listing Company ships, cargoes, and secret rendezvous points.`
            `The ledger is written in shorthand. Only a retired clerk at Port Azure can read it, and Company agents are watching the coast.`
            `The names include ordinary merchants as well as privateers. Someone is financing the operation through respectable trading houses.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The names include ordinary merchants as well as privateers. Someone is financing the operation through respectable trading houses.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `The harbourmaster presses the ledger into your hands. “A quiet delivery, captain. The fewer people who know what you carry, the better.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Pilot's Ledger. Carry the ledger to Elian Rusk at Port Azure. Keep it below deck and out of the inspectors' sight."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Elian deciphers the entries. One name appears again and again: Commodore Silas Ashcombe, the Company officer recruiting Vane's former crew.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The Company is not merely taxing ports. It is building a private navy under Ashcombe.`
        log "Completed The Pilot's Ledger. Received 430 gold. The Company is not merely taxing ports. It is building a private navy under Ashcombe."
